---
import LinkButton from "@/components/LinkButton.astro";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl border-t border-border px-6 py-24">

  <div class="grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-center">

    <!-- Left -->

    <div>

      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">
        About Querywala
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight">
        Practical knowledge from real-world implementations.
      </h2>

      <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-9 text-muted">
        Querywala is a technical publication dedicated to Microsoft Fabric,
        Azure, SQL, Power BI, AI, and Enterprise Data Engineering.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-9 text-muted">
        Every guide is based on practical experience building production
        data platforms, implementing analytics solutions, and solving
        real engineering challenges—not just sample projects.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-9 text-muted">
        The goal is simple: publish high-quality, implementation-focused
        articles that help engineers, analysts, architects, and developers
        build better data solutions.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <LinkButton href="/about">
          Learn More About Querywala
        </LinkButton>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right -->

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-surface p-8">

      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
        What you'll find here
      </h3>

      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-5">

        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-accent text-xl">✓</span>
          <span>Production-ready Microsoft Fabric tutorials</span>
        </li>

        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-accent text-xl">✓</span>
          <span>Architecture and implementation guides</span>
        </li>

        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-accent text-xl">✓</span>
          <span>Power BI and SQL best practices</span>
        </li>

        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-accent text-xl">✓</span>
          <span>Performance tuning and troubleshooting</span>
        </li>

        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-accent text-xl">✓</span>
          <span>Governance, security and enterprise patterns</span>
        </li>

        <li class="flex gap-4">
          <span class="text-accent text-xl">✓</span>
          <span>Automation, AI and modern data engineering</span>
        </li>

      </ul>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>